/-- **The multi-chart headline on `Pt`, end to end (BUILT).** `𝓗⁺_N = φ⁻¹{U = 0} ≠ ∅`, and for
every good `G`: properness and `KLi(S_τ) = KLs(S_τ) = 𝓗⁺_N`, obtained from
